{"version":1,"key":"card:479","content":{"id":479,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"模块 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 让你能够轻松地迭代一系列文本文件中的所有行。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8b972b3d-ea37-48b1-874e-50773b46ffad","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"使用模块 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，在 UNIX 管道中使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cat","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 调用脚本的效果将与以命令行参数的方式向脚本提供文件名一样。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1f3bbd46-a167-4b64-b390-c2158651cafa","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"$ cat file.txt | python some_script.py","collabId":"2b909f36-04b7-48d2-b6e8-b3028d683142","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"56fd2f1a-87f7-4e1a-9550-9078b9b1aaeb","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c897af4f-e6ab-45b4-9c96-c7a3e0f48f39"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"$ python some_script.py file.txt","collabId":"77ac3c84-e70c-4bfc-a68f-767464278aa0","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"48213efc-f5b4-4361-b42f-fedcf89c4359","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a89cb1f4-69fe-4c47-ba80-5fa08febe1ea"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f22a871f-4137-4eb2-a9d3-8a70b7287d7f","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b30647ba-7f94-4986-9a80-bd5b6413d88c.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b30647ba-7f94-4986-9a80-bd5b6413d88c.png"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.input","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是其中最重要的函数，它返回一个可在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"for","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 循环中进行迭代的对象","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c08ad5c7-93d0-4007-9a1c-9f0ffbe4cde7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"还可将参数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inplace","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 设置为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"True","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，这样将就地进行处理","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e11d5db5-154b-4de1-af5b-ab23c2e236e4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6e2bd434-0742-47a8-8504-8babe005a454","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"就地进行处理时，可选参数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"backup","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 用于给从原始文件创建的备份文件指定扩展名","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fdc480d1-e3ad-4344-a312-2d93f00515f4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"05469e39-6cf3-4dee-94cd-6bb16835e61b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"fa2d0dec-c862-4d2c-b37d-1ff795439695","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"606fcb61-cb95-40cc-9eca-cf85c670ea6e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.filename","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 返回当前文件（即当前处理的行所属文件）的文件名","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4f000a1a-d800-4fec-864b-8efb7110099c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"bc69ec6a-66a1-4c37-9b19-a852af696be0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.lineno","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 返回当前行的编号。这个值是累计的，因此处理完一个文件并接着处理下一个文件时，不会重置行号，而是从前一个文件最后一行的行号加 1 开始","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ca38320c-3705-4164-bce6-0c637641c972","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"708dba70-db3e-4c22-b5c3-43662c67879d","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.filelineno","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 返回当前行在当前文件中的行号。每次处理完一个文件并接着处理下一个文件时，将重置这个行号并从 1 重新开始","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"592b4f80-781f-4b2b-829b-7940b7bc04cc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f3f77c69-5677-4d35-88ce-fbdbfede5849","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.isfirstline","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 在当前行为当前文件中的第一行时返回 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"True","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，否则返回 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"False","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d07e1782-ecf0-4f3f-8be1-2686f0000fcd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"d03d4ef8-679c-4ce6-b099-6be19e71c710","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.nextfile","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 关闭当前文件并跳到下一个文件，且计数时忽略跳过的行","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0a77a9a0-568b-42ec-ab9e-912d4dced6e8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4bb588c4-78b0-44f3-aea9-518f81f7dd75","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileinput.close","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 关闭整个文件链并结束迭代","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0c4c4a57-c17e-4c04-a471-0e54592084ff","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ac06dbd0-26ed-4d9c-ba77-3e40e1b1ee2c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"6c25d918-4704-4489-9f28-6dd40b806fef","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"假设你编写了一个 Python 脚本，并想给其中的代码行加上行号。鉴于你希望这样处理后程序依然能够正常运行，因此必须在每行末尾以注释的方式添加行号。为让这些行号对齐，可使用字符串格式设置功能。假设只允许每行代码最多包含 40 个字符，并在第 41 个字符处开始添加注释。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c350c335-9e7a-48e4-a955-fd33a1f52d71","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# numberlines.py\n\n\nimport fileinput\n\n\nfor line in fileinput.input(inplace=True):\n    line = line.rstrip()\n    num = fileinput.lineno()\n    print('{:<50} # {:2d}'.format(line, num))","collabId":"3d635d9e-8121-4780-8fb8-47161dc2f083","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f00c199f-89e7-4813-a25a-78e1025ddeb5","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"5cb345db-e4dc-43aa-b6bf-086b2262f0fd"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"python numberlines.py numberlines.py","collabId":"c4f7d6b4-32b1-4e8c-9567-6c14ed932d1e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"8093ba3f-82a2-4f36-96dd-20c61e963282","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f47d9e6a-ec18-42ce-9aa1-57b36dd31a2d"},{"calloutType":"warning","children":[{"children":[{"text":"务必慎用参数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inplace","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，因为这很容易破坏文件。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9789cbd4-6b0b-43c5-ba21-5248079c6d14","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2c08c65b-a749-4f91-a028-0a34906bf67a","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"tags":["Python/标准库/fileinput"],"createTime":1719398549221,"updateTime":1793532526276,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532526276}}